# Raw screen recordings — the large masters that scripts/make-clips.mjs cuts
# from. Only the small clips it emits into public/clips belong in the repo.
#
# NOTE: /incoming/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the hand-off path for
# getting a master into the repo once, so that `git add` does not silently skip
# it. Once its clips are cut, the master is deleted again and only the clips
# remain.
/assets/
